<?php
return ['name' => 'attuned_ding_fire_the_glow', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Attuned Ding Fire – The Glow', 'zh' => '身弱丁火'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Attuned Ding Fire is the flame of a candle at its most delicate – gentle, subtle, yet enduring. When its inner fire is \'weak\' or softly attuned, it isn\'t a roaring blaze; instead, it\'s a warm glow that needs nurturing and patience. Its strength lies not in being the brightest bonfire, but in providing a steady, comforting light that gently brightens a small space and brings solace to others. As The Glow, its journey is to become an irreplaceable light source in its chosen niche. Attuned Ding Fire learns to focus its warmth in a specific domain, using its delicate but lasting flame to illuminate others\' lives. In doing so, it discovers that a quietly persistent light can offer unique value – consistently guiding and comforting those around it.</p><p>Mild & Harmonious: You have a kind, easygoing temperament. Naturally diplomatic, you handle situations smoothly and can sense what others are feeling. This ability to put people at ease makes you a soothing presence in any group.<br/>Meticulous & Thoughtful: Rich in emotion and highly considerate, you think things through carefully and pay attention to the little details. You strive to be thorough in everything you do. However, your tendency to overthink can sometimes lead to hesitation or indecision when it\'s time to act.<br/>Steadfast at Heart: On the surface you seem flexible and accommodating, but deep down you hold firmly to your principles. You maintain a slow-burning determination toward goals that truly matter to you – like a candle flame that refuses to extinguish, quietly burning until it achieves their aim.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Wood, Fire. Your flame can sometimes feel underpowered or scattered when you\'re not in a strong phase. By drawing on Wood and Fire energy around you, you steadily fuel your inner light so it burns a bit brighter. Wood feeds your flame with growth and creativity, while Fire from external sources adds vitality. With the support of these elements, your enthusiasm grows more confident and your natural advantages shine through more easily.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>Your financial journey favors stability and teamwork over high-stakes gambles. It\'s wise for you to avoid high-risk investments or speculative money moves; they would only heighten your anxiety. Instead, focus on steady saving and collaborative ventures to build wealth. You often find that partnering with trusted friends or family, or pooling resources with mentors, brings you better financial opportunities than going solo. Over time – especially by middle age – your money luck stabilizes and improves. Just be careful: don\'t use retail therapy or impulse purchases to cope when you\'re feeling low. Emotional spending can leak away the wealth you work so hard to accumulate. Keeping a cool head and managing your moods will help ensure your savings grow securely.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Pay extra attention to your heart and circulatory health. Regular exercise and avoiding all-nighters will protect your cardiovascular system. Aim for a balanced, nutritious diet to keep your energy levels steady – being gentle with yourself includes getting enough sleep and greens! Also, guard against eye strain from too much screen time. Make a habit of looking away from your work periodically or doing eye exercises to prevent fatigue. Finally, strengthen your immune system by maintaining consistent sleep patterns. A well-rested Glow will shine longer and stronger.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>You have a rich inner world and tend to carry worries quietly, which means stress and anxiety can build up without others realizing. Rather than bottling up your feelings, it\'s important for you to find safe ways to let them out and heal. Meditation might become your secret weapon – a few minutes of calm breathing or mindfulness each day can help clear away the mental clutter. Additionally, creative or therapeutic outlets like art therapy, journaling, or gentle music can work wonders for your soul. Losing yourself in art or creativity lets you express what\'s inside and soothe your sensitive spirit. Remember: even a soft, steady flame needs tending. By embracing calming rituals and creative release, you\'ll keep your emotional glow warm and stable.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Education: You flourish in teaching and nurturing roles. Consider careers as a school teacher, early childhood educator, or vocational trainer – even online education or special education, where patience and empathy are paramount. Your gentle guidance and idealism can profoundly shape growing minds. Writing & Culture: Fields like publishing, writing, editing, or library and museum work suit your thoughtful, detail-oriented nature. You could excel as a novelist, editor, archivist, cultural researcher, or historian, preserving and illuminating knowledge with care. Counseling & Consulting: Your instinct to support others makes you a natural counselor or advisor. You would thrive as a psychologist or therapist, career coach, human resources specialist, or in non-profit and community service roles. These paths let you channel your empathetic, service-oriented side to help people improve their lives. Health & Wellness: Holistic wellness fields mesh well with your caring disposition. You might be drawn to alternative medicine (like being an herbalist or acupuncturist), nutrition coaching, physical therapy, or as a yoga/meditation instructor. You enjoy gently guiding others toward better health and balance. Design & Craftsmanship: Roles that require an artistic eye and patience – such as graphic or UI/UX design, floral arrangement, lighting design, or handcrafting – appeal to your meticulousness. In creative industries, you put a piece of your heart into each project, and your fine-tuned approach stands out. Spiritual & Philosophical Fields: You may even find fulfillment in roles that bridge culture and spirituality, like a teacher of traditional cultural arts, a feng shui or astrology consultant, or a researcher in philosophy and metaphysics. Your introspective nature and desire to help give you an edge in guiding others through life\'s deeper questions. Where Energy Feels Drained: High Finance & Law: High-pressure environments like investment banking, day trading, or intense legal battles can overwhelm your gentle temperament. These careers demand aggressive risk-taking and quick decisive strikes, which clash with your preference for careful deliberation and security. Maritime & Shipping: Occupations such as sea navigation, shipping logistics, or commercial fishing are rough and unpredictably demanding. The volatile conditions and constant change would likely unsettle you, pulling you far out of your comfort zone. Heavy Industry & Mining: Work in mines, metallurgy, or heavy machinery manufacturing is physically and mentally intense, often with harsh, solitary conditions. Such environments leave little room for the sensitivity and emotional expression that you need to thrive. Military & Policing: Strict regimented roles like soldier, police officer, or judge (in a criminal court sense) could be draining. These professions require a tough exterior and sometimes confrontational approach that might conflict with your compassionate, peace-seeking nature. Forestry & Agriculture: Oddly, even some seemingly calm outdoor jobs like commercial forestry or large-scale farming could prove challenging. They can involve unpredictable natural challenges and business pressures that may cause you undue stress. Fast Fashion & Manufacturing: The fast-paced world of fashion manufacturing or textile production, with its relentless deadlines and demand for constant trend-chasing, might fray your nerves. You prefer a more sustainable, steady approach rather than the rush and pressure of ever-changing demands.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jia Wood: Reliable Jia Wood friends provide security like sheltering trees.</li><li>Bing Fire: Enthusiastic Bing Fire friends help share burdens and face challenges together.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jia Wood: Protective Jia Wood partners provide security and resource support.</li><li>Bing Fire: Positive Bing Fire partners shine like sunlight, lifting spirits and dispelling negativity.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Usain Bolt: The world\'s fastest man, an Olympic sprinter with eight gold medals. Despite his explosive speed on the track, off the track Bolt is known for his joyful, lighthearted spirit and generosity, reflecting how a steady positive attitude can coexist with remarkable achievement</li><li>Taylor Swift: A globally renowned singer-songwriter who channels deep emotions and storytelling into her music. Swift\'s approachable, authentic persona and her supportive connection with fans mirror the Attuned Ding Fire\'s ability to touch others gently yet powerfully</li><li>Kim Kardashian: An influential media personality and entrepreneur who launched an inclusive shapewear brand that embraces diverse body types. Kim\'s way of quietly reshaping beauty standards and using her platform to encourage self-confidence shows how a steady influence can gradually change societal norms</li><li>Kevin Durant: An NBA superstar whose on-court finesse is matched by a relatively soft-spoken, thoughtful off-court demeanor. Durant often credits mentors and teamwork for his success, illustrating the attuned flame\'s appreciation for collaboration and support in achieving greatness</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Mao Zedong: A revolutionary leader and founding father of modern China. While known for his formidable influence, Mao also spent years in patient ideological struggle and grassroots organization, demonstrating how enduring resolve (even if quietly nurtured at first) can spark massive change</li><li>Jack Ma: Co-founder of Alibaba Group, who built one of the world\'s largest e-commerce empires through collaborative effort and visionary patience. He advocates for inclusive finance and has supported education and environmental causes, embodying the spirit of using one\'s gentle influence to uplift communities</li><li>Zhang Yimou: A famous film director who combines poetic subtlety with strong vision. His works often have a soft emotional core that resonates widely, proving that gentle artistry can have profound impact and international acclaim</li><li>Mei Lanfang: A Peking Opera master who brought a traditionally gentle art to global prominence by carefully nourishing it and innovating within its form. His lifelong dedication to his craft reflects the patient cultivation of talent and culture characteristic of The Glow\'s influence</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Café Meetups: Arrange to meet friends or colleagues in cozy cafés or libraries. These relaxed environments help you open up and connect, which steadily strengthens your social network. A warm chat over coffee or tea aligns perfectly with your gentle vibe</li><li>Nature on Your Screen: Set your phone\'s lock screen to an image of a sunrise or a serene forest. Each time you check your phone, you\'ll get a small emotional boost. The sunrise symbolizes hope and renewal for your delicate fire, and a lush forest embodies the Wood energy that sustains your flame</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Red & Purple (Fire): Fiery reds signify passion and drive, while rich purples inspire imagination and courage. Using touches of red and purple can supercharge your confidence and proactiveness, helping your mild flame act with more boldness when needed. Try adding a red accessory or a purple decoration in your space – it\'s like lighting a personal \'confidence lamp\' that pushes you to take initiative and follow through on plans.</li><li>Green & Teal (Wood): Green and teal hues represent growth, wisdom, and vitality. They sharpen your clarity of thought and attract helpful people into your life. Incorporating green plants, teal fabrics, or other verdant accents around you is like inviting wise mentors and fresh ideas into your space. These colors help your interactions flow more easily and your ideas sprout with less effort, keeping your gentle flame fueled with insight.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>South (Fire): The south radiates active, fiery energy that can enhance your financial luck. Facing south or spending time in a south-facing room can help convert your gentle warmth into prosperity and opportunity. Need a spark of motivation or a luck boost in your career? Try doing your work or meditation facing the southern direction to ignite that productive energy.</li><li>East (Wood): Eastern energy symbolizes sunrise, growth, and learning – perfect for your personal development. Facing east when you study or brainstorm can stimulate your creativity and learning capacity. You might also decorate the eastern side of your home or office with something meaningful (like a vision board or a favorite object) to invite continuous inspiration and fresh starts.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>丁火为烛光之火，温和而细腻，身弱则火性不烈，需要耐心呵护。它的力量不在于耀眼炽烈，而在于持久稳健，能在有限的范围内为环境带来温暖与安慰。</p><p>温和圆融：性格温和，处事圆融，洞察力强，能体察他人感受。<br/>细腻周全：情感丰富，行事多思虑，注意细节，但有时容易犹豫不决。<br/>内心坚守：表面随和，实则有原则，对目标保持暗火般的坚持，如灯芯缓慢燃烧。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身弱丁火，喜用神为木、火。丁火如灯火，身弱时容易热情不足或力量分散。若能借助木火之力，就能稳步提升能量。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>需要避免高风险投资或投机行为，适合稳定储蓄、合作求财。通过团队、长辈或朋友获取资源，中年后运势渐稳。但要切记不要因为心情差就乱花钱。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>注意心血管健康，避免熬夜、均衡饮食；预防眼部疲劳，减少长时间用眼；增强免疫力，保证充足睡眠。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>内心思虑重，易产生焦虑情绪。可通过静心、艺术疗愈等方式疏解。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：文化教育：学校、培训机构、文化机构。农林业：农场、林场、园艺公司。生态保护：环保组织、自然保护区、生态修复。宠物护理：宠物医院、宠物店、宠物服务。园艺：园艺设计、花卉种植、园林绿化。手工艺者：手工艺品制作、传统工艺、艺术创作。摄影：摄影师、影像制作、视觉设计。作家：写作、文学创作、内容创作。餐饮：餐厅、咖啡店、茶艺。自媒体运营：内容创作、社交媒体、个人品牌。慎重行业：金融风险类：高风险投资、投机交易、财务杠杆。重工制造类：重工业、机械制造、汽车工业。诉讼律师：法律诉讼、争议解决、复杂法律问题。审计：财务审计、内控审核、风险评估。物流运输：物流管理、运输、仓储。水产养殖：海洋养殖、渔业、水产品加工。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>甲木：甲木朋友正直可靠，像大树一样为你遮风挡雨，提供安全感。</li><li>丙火：丙火朋友热情开朗，帮助你分担压力，适合共同创业，应对挑战。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>甲木：甲木是守护型伴侣，可以为你提供安全感和资源支持。</li><li>丙火：丙火作为伴侣积极乐观，像阳光一般照亮生活，可以带你走出消极情绪。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Usain Bolt：奥运短跑八金得主</li><li>Taylor Swift：全球现象级创作型歌手</li><li>Kim Kardashian：创立塑身品牌包容多元体型，打破审美刻板印象</li><li>Kevin Durant：NBA巨星</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>毛泽东：革命领袖，政治家</li><li>马云：阿里巴巴集团创始人，推动中国电子商务与普惠金融，支持乡村教育及环境保护</li><li>马化腾：腾讯创始人</li><li>张艺谋：知名导演</li><li>梅兰芳：京剧大师，创立\'梅派\'艺术，将京剧推向世界</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>与人见面可以多约在咖啡店/书店</li><li>手机锁屏可以用日出/森林图片</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>红色 / 紫色（火）：红色象征热情与动力，紫色带来灵感与勇气。二者能增强自信与行动力。</li><li>绿色 / 青色（木）：绿色和青色象征生长与智慧，能提升思维清晰度，同时带来贵人运。</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>南方（火）：南方的能量能提升财运，让丁火的能量得到更有效的转化。</li><li>东方（木）：东方的能量象征生长与学习，能增强学习能力与思考力。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
